Description: cypou 4k Intro/2004/Linux
 Canyon Flight is a 4k intro written in C with SDL 1.2 and OpenGL by
 Nathael PAJANI and Cyprien LAPLACE (cypou) for the 2004 Linux 4k compo
 listed on 320x200.org.
 .
 A small plane flies through an endless, randomly generated canyon and
 switches lanes to avoid the walls that block its way. Each run is
 different. Press Escape or close the window to quit.
 .
 Some 30 hours of coding, including nights and meals.
